[{"id":"1248425186044461062","date":1586482733000,"rawContent":"My latest on #EthnicStudies as part of our movement work. Inspired by the #BlackLivesMatter herstory, penned by my sister\/friend\/comrade @aliciagarza.","media":null,"username":"DocMellyMel","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":1.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":349,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":6,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":1.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":0.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1248688326971756545","date":1586545471000,"rawContent":"Can we please stop speaking in terms like \"most vulnerable,\" \"underserved,\" and even \"communities of color,\" in order to make folks comfortable?\nLet's be explicit.\n#COVID\u30fc19 deaths are a Black issue.\nA Black-specific response is required.\n#BlackLivesMatter @Blklivesmatter @BLMLA","media":null,"username":"DocMellyMel","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":2.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":350,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":6,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":2.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":0.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1251975689500160002","date":1587329239000,"rawContent":"New CA data debunks last week's reports, confirming what we knew.\nCalifornia is not unique. \nBlack people are dying of #COVID19 at double our population share.\nMore proof of the \"underlying condition\" of anti-Black racism. #BlackLivesMatter https:\/\/t.co\/3a6IwhKFHT","media":["https:\/\/pbs.twimg.com\/media\/EV_o2H-U4AAlt91?format=jpg&name=orig"],"username":"DocMellyMel","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":3.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":351,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":6,"sumOfClimat